WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.720
Well, there are a few things.

2
00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:04.440
The obvious one is that you can have
a home and build wealth without

3
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:06.360
needing a deposit or a mortgage.

4
00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:08.400
But it's also about flexibility.

5
00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:11.360
If your life changes,
your housing can change with it.

6
00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:13.520
And then there are the homes themselves.

7
00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:16.280
They're designed to be places that 
you genuinely want to live,

8
00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:20.080
not just houses built as quickly
and as cheaply as possible.

9
00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:23.640
The homes are high quality
 and everything is sorted for you.

10
00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.280
And over time there
are other benefits too,

11
00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:29.520
like maintenance and everyday 
essentials being taken care of.

12
00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:31.120
So life becomes simpler.

13
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:34.440
It's about having a home with 
less stress and more freedom.